{"id":50933,"date":"2026-05-01T09:43:00","date_gmt":"2026-05-01T08:43:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50933"},"modified":"2026-09-02T19:33:58","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T18:33:58","slug":"stone-race-ocr","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/stone-race-ocr\/","title":{"rendered":"Stone Race OCR 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Stone Race OCR 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Stone Race OCR 2026<\/strong> (Fun Edition) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Almeirim<\/strong>, capital gastron\u00f3mica da afamada Sopa da Pedra, no distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Organizada pela Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de OCR da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o dos 20 km de Almeirim<\/strong>, a prova consolida-se como um dos grandes eventos de corrida de obst\u00e1culos do Ribatejo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada no <strong>Parque Urbano da Zona Norte<\/strong> (Avenida D. Jo\u00e3o I) a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong>, o percurso de <strong>6 km<\/strong> conta com mais de <strong>30 obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> naturais e artificiais \u2014 integrando zonas de suspens\u00e3o com sino, passagens de \u00e1gua, muros, rastejos, cargas e combos de agilidade \u2014, divididos pelas categorias Elite, Open e Team Building (equipas de 4 elementos com oferta de almo\u00e7o tradicional de porco no espeto no final).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px so